    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "considering solutions to the heat equation with a space-time periodic, zero-mean in space source f(t,x), ∂tu − ∆u = f. (1.6)"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
